{"page":98,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:122","surah":4,"ayah":122,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ سَنُدْخِلُهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا ۖ وَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ حَقًّا ۚ وَمَنْ أَصْدَقُ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ قِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but We shall admit those who believe and do good deeds into Gardens graced with flowing streams, there to remain for ever––a true promise from God. Who speaks more truly than God?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[the] righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَنُدْخِلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"We will admit them","transliteration":"sanud'khiluhum","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"(in) Gardens","transliteration":"jannātin","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flow","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَحْتِهَا","en_gloss":"underneath it","transliteration":"taḥtihā","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","en_gloss":"the rivers","transliteration":"l-anhāru","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"will abide","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيهَآ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَبَدًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"forever","transliteration":"abadan","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعْدَ","en_gloss":"A Promise","transliteration":"waʿda","verse_key":"4:122"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4: